---
import LayoutV2 from '../layouts/LayoutV2.astro';

// The date the wording last changed, not the build date. Update it whenever this text is edited.
const LAST_UPDATED = '10 March 2026';
---

<LayoutV2
  title="Cookie Policy | DemandGenix"
  description="Learn about how DemandGenix uses cookies on our website and how you can manage your preferences."
  schema={{
    abstract: 'Which cookies DemandGenix uses on its website, what each is for, the third-party services involved, and how to manage your preferences.',
    breadcrumbs: [
      { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
      { name: 'Cookie policy', url: '/cookie-policy/' }
    ]
  }}
>
  <div class="dg-wrap dg-wrap--read">
    <header class="dg-hero dg-hero--solo dg-hero--legal">
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="dg-legal__updated">Last updated: {LAST_UPDATED}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="dg-prose">
<section>
  <h2>What Are Cookies?</h2>
  <p>
    Cookies are small text files that are placed on your computer or mobile device when you visit our website. 
    They help us provide you with a better experience by remembering your preferences and understanding how you use our site.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Types of Cookies We Use</h2>
  
  <div>
    <h3>Essential Cookies</h3>
    <p>These cookies are necessary for the website to function properly and cannot be disabled.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Cookie consent preferences</li>
      <li>Security and authentication</li>
      <li>Basic website functionality</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h3>Analytics Cookies</h3>
    <p>Help us understand how visitors interact with our website.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> Tracks page views, session duration, and user behavior</li>
      <li><strong>Dreamdata:</strong> Marketing attribution and pipeline analytics — tracks which channels and touchpoints drive pipeline and revenue</li>
      <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Improve website performance and measure marketing effectiveness</li>
      <li><strong>Data collected:</strong> Anonymous usage statistics, page views, form interactions, and attribution data</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h3>Marketing Cookies</h3>
    <p>Used to track visitors across websites for advertising purposes.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>HubSpot:</strong> Form analytics, lead tracking, and marketing automation</li>
      <li><strong>LinkedIn Insights:</strong> Tracks conversions from LinkedIn ads</li>
      <li><strong>Google Ads:</strong> Measures ad effectiveness and enables remarketing</li>
      <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Deliver relevant advertisements and measure campaign performance</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Managing Your Cookie Preferences</h2>
  <p>You can control your cookie preferences in several ways:</p>
  
  <h3>Our Cookie Consent Tool</h3>
  <p>
    Use our cookie banner and settings modal to choose which types of cookies you'd like to accept.
    <button type="button" id="manage-cookies">Manage Cookie Settings</button>
  </p>

  <h3>Browser Settings</h3>
  <p>You can also manage cookies through your browser settings:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Chrome:</strong> Settings → Privacy and Security → Cookies and other site data</li>
    <li><strong>Firefox:</strong> Settings → Privacy & Security → Cookies and Site Data</li>
    <li><strong>Safari:</strong> Preferences → Privacy → Manage Website Data</li>
    <li><strong>Edge:</strong> Settings → Cookies and site permissions</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>We use the following third-party services that may set cookies:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>HubSpot:</strong> <a href="https://legal.hubspot.com/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a></li>
    <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></li>
    <li><strong>Dreamdata:</strong> <a href="https://dreamdata.io/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a></li>
    <li><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/legal/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a></li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <p>
    If you have any questions about our use of cookies, please contact us at:
    <a href="mailto:hello@demandgenix.uk">hello@demandgenix.uk</a>
  </p>
</section>
    </div>
  </div>
</LayoutV2>

<script>
  document.getElementById('manage-cookies')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    (window as any).openCookiePreferences?.();
  });
</script>
